"m-db0e8a29-5da6-4ca1-bdba-23b7914b92ee" ulx="451" uly="1409" lrx="531" lry="1437" /><zone xml:id="m-c9390eab-4a8e-4dda-ae4f-c139c1f11457" ulx="478" uly="1428" lrx="873" lry="1464" /><zone xml:id="m-de6cd1a2-1038-47af-9a8e-956a44a1d183" ulx="44" uly="1432" lrx="438" lry="1464" /><zone xml:id="m-e52fbb5f-06ba-43a7-9fef-17e421e236ee" ulx="451" uly="1457" lrx="872" lry="1492" /><zone xml:id="m-d36e2c60-2394-4d75-bf1d-041eec5f5904" ulx="19" uly="1458" lrx="438" lry="1492" /><zone xml:id="m-d09f59e6-2fcd-4e54-9d00-808036f88489" ulx="449" uly="1485" lrx="870" lry="1521" /><zone xml:id="m-6e60a59a-f4a8-417d-b8a7-af42818e72a3" ulx="19" uly="1489" lrx="200" lry="1524" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-dc94bfed-ddc3-4778-8a84-f63927311ca1" n="1981" facs="#m-e6c52f26-e542-4985-b760-e2100c4e8d72" /><div xml:id="m-fd7db951-bf36-4392-b3ee-80768756d4be">
            <lg xml:id="m-f669fcb2-4cb0-4077-a5c5-272839e618b1">
              <l xml:id="m-9cd43252-908c-4b60-9bb7-bc9ac05612d5" facs="#m-fae2ae3b-da6e-4856-b1fe-0299de4fd212" label="ambiguous">November 2.</l><l xml:id="m-8fdadf35-d800-404a-891b-99d8d360d3e8" facs="#m-afd727f3-bd60-4510-9d57-aef10a62063e" label="ambiguous">1735</l><l xml:id="m-22e03d90-5d74-447b-935f-0d0d3968ca69" facs="#m-1802c3a4-26e1-4b01-952b-636783c2ed9e" label="lyrics-like">strium. Alia cláritas solis, ália clá¬ get in incorruptióne. Seminátur in</l><l xml:id="m-63837ad0-9666-409e-88c7-6dd20ba257c7" facs="#m-fcb45796-5e87-417f-b995-a52ceae2cff5" label="lyrics-like">ritas lunae, et ália cláritas stellá¬</l><l xml:id="m-b665586d-9251-4dca-9324-1efba393f546" facs="#m-467879f5-a9d6-44b8-891c-6b04bbafb5a3" label="lyrics-like">ignobilitáte, surget in glória. Semi¬</l><l xml:id="m-df75cf5e-1fd1-4c29-b962-078afb04eec1" facs="#m-d27f6d75-5bc4-4f29-b073-52072f2728e2" label="ambiguous">rum. Stella enim a stella differt in</l><l xml:id="m-b17e3c6e-654c-4bdd-82c9-0fed61089a05" facs="#m-ffacd381-182d-4034-89e2-1edeb0f73e16" label="lyrics-like">nátur in infirmitáte, surget in vir¬</l><l xml:id="m-6f530d20-1c59-406f-866f-b76906c69597" facs="#m-3249d41e-c5c2-45b0-b353-73b40eff1f9d" label="lyrics-like">claritáte : sic et resurréctio mortuó¬</l><l xml:id="m-3add1dc5-b545-4bc8-ba7d-b5dca6f3750d" facs="#m-c31e3584-cdc0-4645-b80d-04852c8148b8" label="lyrics-like">túte. Seminátur corpus animále,</l><l xml:id="m-056c7276-2141-493c-989b-35f099c67c0a" facs="#m-f3c367a7-c6c2-4fa4-8be2-812457f2e96e" label="lyrics-like">rum. Seminátur in corruptióne, sur-l surget corpus spiritálé.</l><l xml:id="m-33c8f7e2-92ac-4319-9351-508822ae9590" facs="#m-6a35bc1f-e918-40b0-a404-9d4030687937" label="lyrics-like">K. Dómine. p. 1798.</l><l xml:id="m-cec45530-1cf8-4660-975a-8b160e217b35" facs="#m-18a2b636-edd4-498b-80b0-84792a07af17" label="ambiguous">Cap. 15, 51-58.</l><l xml:id="m-2dc61766-5160-46cb-832d-5d48c6d88004" facs="#m-3f71f551-f366-4cfc-a766-c0cb0afa3305" label="ambiguous">Lesson IX.</l><l xml:id="m-9f41cd32-ac11-412f-b76f-fab90614f95f" facs="#m-551d517c-b873-4bfe-ba77-5321cc303297" label="lyrics-like">(Cce mystérium vobis dico:</l><l xml:id="m-70fbdc69-d295-4658-bacf-6ae8fd407fe8" facs="#m-6d2318ac-2141-437b-a01e-3ef6a1274ebc" label="lyrics-like">est mors in victória. Ubi est, mors,</l><l xml:id="m-1d6cebff-6db5-4549-83e0-34f77dee60ea" facs="#m-e3841f8a-5743-4090-9c39-e9db6ed32d2c" label="lyrics-like">C Omnes quidem resurgémus, sed</l><l xml:id="m-2353453f-8f54-460d-be01-6303793bcd20" facs="#m-a070ea00-8fdc-49c9-a8f6-a6925a069b6d" label="lyrics-like">victória tua? ubi est, mors, stímu¬</l><l xml:id="m-c2a5f4d1-d565-41f5-968e-7d2dbc5edb53" facs="#m-1002718b-131a-49e7-9260-41fccc4ffdf9" label="lyrics-like">lus tuus? Stímulus autem mortis</l><l xml:id="m-dde50f59-1885-4272-8f73-56fbc40a657b" facs="#m-ad7cb4a8-b7d4-4bc1-927a-c83041621372" label="lyrics-like">non omnes immutábimur. In mo¬</l><l xml:id="m-f0afc8ab-00d0-4355-a158-727f5ae70972" facs="#m-0552d867-b767-41bb-b6fb-5ef76845c19b" label="lyrics-like">peccátum est : virtus vero peccãti</l><l xml:id="m-5e8401e1-11fc-4a09-a98e-623913289c7a" facs="#m-dee31691-4bef-4094-ab9f-bf8c4a168806" label="lyrics-like">ménto, in ictu óculi, in novissima</l><l xml:id="m-14f436af-6d9e-490b-a726-04ed7dbe01d1" facs="#m-d4e7bdc6-3bb7-4a78-b93b-b98eb80c64f3" label="lyrics-like">lex. Deo autem grátias, qui dedit</l><l xml:id="m-a1fcfa15-4203-4aaa-a7e9-73da01de9302" facs="#m-3c2a4ff1-9c9d-489c-a863-011866b7ed88" label="lyrics-like">tuba: canet enim tuba, et mórtui</l><l xml:id="m-537ac70d-0b94-4686-8384-6498a806222c" facs="#m-d441a464-d231-414a-8993-fd7a58fb597d" label="lyrics-like">resúrgent incorrúpti : et nos immu¬</l><l xml:id="m-6919bb0b-8d72-4a43-96cd-536503f1567e" facs="#m-26813172-3958-4781-bcf0-86e0b3437984" label="lyrics-like">nobis victóriam per Dóminum no¬</l><l xml:id="m-cf9764a7-f1bb-40db-b506-e5b7d2bc9a52" facs="#m-17d900d9-e2f6-4d89-b494-16545b78263f" label="lyrics-like">tábimur. Opórtet enim corruptibile</l><l xml:id="m-06905c81-4ba5-4716-b7ec-23584d8f5fcf" facs="#m-61a2b6b0-0fd1-40c6-b9b8-4266be1f8317" label="ambiguous">strum Jesum Christum. Itaque, fra¬</l><l xml:id="m-2fede6eb-7510-4c54-82bd-eb0c57a3199a" facs="#m-2de767c3-3497-4717-be72-926a25fc9c7a" label="lyrics-like">tres mei dilécti, stábiles estôte et</l><l xml:id="m-ac0c5f98-56ad-40fd-8e07-d6bde13aa72a" facs="#m-4400613f-724e-4660-81e4-4f7ad72a83e4" label="lyrics-like">hoc indúere incorruptiónem: </l><l xml:id="m-a48a5778-37f4-433b-b477-a89e09007a57" facs="#m-ecc178f5-95ec-444e-9b1d-0fc7e337b6f8" label="lyrics-like">mortále hoc indúere immortalitá¬</l><l xml:id="m-a842966e-3b9c-4052-9e9b-fecab563ea08" facs="#m-a3e1eed8-9bf7-4dd4-8134-2dc2b4dbf714" label="lyrics-like">immóbiles: abundántes in ópere</l><l xml:id="m-a96490a6-393b-4336-8a51-09fbdc98253a" facs="#m-0979242e-c114-4ba7-82da-2716ce6cc4f8" label="lyrics-like">tem. Cum autem mortále hoc in¬</l><l xml:id="m-b51fe708-0fae-4b3e-987b-6986768856fe" facs="#m-ff02904b-03b8-4e31-aa60-891036b4b638" label="lyrics-like">Dómini semper, sciéntes quod labor</l><l xml:id="m-c7c9d746-38bc-44e2-9eca-58cebbb30439" facs="#m-e59ff505-9e0f-489e-8254-378b786a57f5" label="lyrics-like">dúerit immortalitátem, tunc fiet</l><l xml:id="m-e8a732ef-3b34-41fa-a3cd-2ec953fe0689" facs="#m-d5284026-c90c-40d5-878d-5893967b6795" label="lyrics-like">vester non est inánis in Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-c9a0643e-91cd-48a4-9c0a-b9fd87d271e4" facs="#m-d8f528be-0858-4a46-8fe1-f72b2a6b7554" label="lyrics-like">sermo, qui scriptus est : Absórpta</l><l xml:id="m-82fdc5cb-f3df-45d0-a5ee-73d6e882be2f" facs="#m-a6cfaa54-faf8-492c-89dc-78f5c0736a04" label="ambiguous">K. Libera. D. 1767.</l><l xml:id="m-9549a780-c7a9-4328-b443-8d261dd49e2e" facs="#m-dda29f83-7bb3-4f5b-a466-ce7421c0871a" label="text-like">At Lauds, all is from the ordinary Office for the Dead, p. 1799. After</l><l xml:id="m-1850bf03-3666-4b2e-9821-3eb71cd1c832" facs="#m-8879915c-6b82-42a0-9dd0-7b5f04f88475" label="text-like">the Canticle Benedictus. and the repetition of the Antiphon, the Ofice ends by</l><l xml:id="m-b2a1a202-4eee-43db-a88f-3be465369ba2" facs="#m-ae27069c-33ba-44bd-bbb5-9ac043ab05fe" label="lyrics-like">the Pâter nóster. the Versicles and the Prayer as at Vespers, p. 1741.</l><l xml:id="m-9dfb889b-c2ab-482c-bef4-487d12a4266d" facs="#m-d301b920-aae8-4203-ae17-c773e48e0311" label="text-like">AT PRIME.</l><l xml:id="m-60bd227b-1e4f-406a-bb0c-e8f76038698a" facs="#m-94d37f75-4886-4ba6-930e-1aa1009d717b" label="text-like">At Prime, Terce, Sext, None and Compline, the Psalms are sung in the</l><l xml:id="m-0a231455-87db-4f6f-b82b-f79e98999ead" facs="#m-9610b35e-ee0c-4501-b583-d3bf15c9e486" label="lyrics-like">Direct tone indicated on p. 1776 for the Psalm 145. Lauda, ánima mea,</l><l xml:id="m-35dc6fb5-5fda-4f63-ab8d-4ceb1e1d6a70" facs="#m-a16b4f5a-10e2-4edb-bc13-027d74ab0fa9" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum. or in the following tone ad libitum, p. 1742.</l><l xml:id="m-69012ef8-d907-4886-8f71-1e424ffb0ce1" facs="#m-659ab3c2-c867-4aaf-932a-6737a4655ff0" label="lyrics-like">Longe fecisti nótos méos a me:"</l><l xml:id="m-450669d8-5167-40c9-9d96-ced93fbc09b1" facs="#m-abac3795-afbe-4cf4-840c-e9b7ea1cb61a" label="ambiguous">Psalm 87.</l><l xml:id="m-fa196abd-afa3-4df3-b00a-a2243cc946f7" facs="#m-d5b572df-b6f1-454a-9ba0-bf2a544a9eda" label="lyrics-like">posuérunt me abominatiónem sibi.</l><l xml:id="m-0479100c-b878-4a96-8300-5d4536c48ce8" facs="#m-3a5434bb-ae6b-46b0-a426-0d76b9741dbb" label="lyrics-like">Omine Déus salútis méae :* in</l><l xml:id="m-31690505-c29a-4e6a-99ae-f206542e0bf8" facs="#m-899e2b97-46fd-4ad2-b593-93e31bcb65f0" label="lyrics-like">Tráditus sum, et nonegrediebar:</l><l xml:id="m-66ce6cd1-7356-4c17-9833-16d535d4c266" facs="#m-e2751cb5-b3cd-42cc-b5eb-562e3b8896b9" label="lyrics-like">U die clamávi, et nócte córam te.</l><l xml:id="m-b24415bd-2701-4a50-a4da-7989653d19ac" facs="#m-e9093775-f445-4610-aa8d-3e86a61ca3cc" label="lyrics-like">óculi méi languérunt prae inópia.</l><l xml:id="m-53ef8de9-8761-460f-8df3-224c18d96673" facs="#m-d3a97967-5486-49cf-ad75-4e54c3988d19" label="lyrics-like">Clamávi ad te, Dómine, tóta</l><l xml:id="m-2eee4082-0a31-4dea-82ed-ea2c1f777bbb" facs="#m-1af77be8-0892-43a8-8a61-41b945302c59" label="lyrics-like">Intret in conspéctu túo orátio</l><l xml:id="m-411f9d82-c8b0-40f3-bb1c-c895c99abb9c" facs="#m-5c3097ad-151b-40a5-9f16-fee4d295b6b5" label="lyrics-like">die:“ expándi ad te mánus méas.</l><l xml:id="m-5cfc2726-0698-4014-8dd8-52d19278cc6f" facs="#m-00ac56f7-11b5-4057-bc47-d9a659e975d0" label="lyrics-like">méa: *inclina aúrem túam ad</l><l xml:id="m-fd1704b7-00c4-41a8-9448-e0595293c665" facs="#m-b97886c3-d49e-466c-8834-4fcd1a9bf141" label="lyrics-like">Numquid mórtuis fácies mirabi¬</l><l xml:id="m-1d9a169d-4b14-4918-abc2-0f596eb1799b" facs="#m-a1d2a31e-a567-4f42-be59-38523f1e9c9f" label="lyrics-like">précem méam:</l><l xml:id="m-943023ed-233b-42f3-b943-c86707bee270" facs="#m-d5664d9a-a31c-413d-bdd1-11b6c4bd3e10" label="lyrics-like">Quia repléta est mális ánima</l><l xml:id="m-9003535a-3382-4664-9d08-1d5ae11b02d7" facs="#m-603e976b-02d9-4ce0-b02e-cc5e02d64447" label="lyrics-like">lia: * aut médici suscitábunt, et</l><l xml:id="m-57e9e03d-df52-4b3b-9bee-071479880201" facs="#m-89294f2d-be0a-4b2a-bdf2-6df97022ff3e" label="lyrics-like">confitebúntur tibi?</l><l xml:id="m-bc4d438b-dff2-4f82-93bb-f08b4345531e" facs="#m-17b5202c-76f6-4321-933a-9037bc2b988b" label="lyrics-like">méa:“ et víta méa inférno appro¬</l><l xml:id="m-932208bb-7580-4e05-85fc-733c50f4402d" facs="#m-c2ecc12d-bc2d-476a-89f9-804b4a9c1355" label="lyrics-like">Numquid narrábit áliquis in se¬</l><l xml:id="m-5e888c02-0985-400d-98e2-4afd1ed4f63c" facs="#m-9fd21780-7332-4ad6-abdb-3ab7aca8a57f" label="lyrics-like">pinquávit.</l><l xml:id="m-750f6e91-bfda-4558-bba8-1277a8fa3ab2" facs="#m-a0837285-9f94-418f-b3de-a9f1dcb7be50" label="lyrics-like">Æstimátus sum cum descendén¬</l><l xml:id="m-105b7d89-70a8-4605-a05e-5f72a4d62cee" facs="#m-2ce7d699-4cbe-49cb-bcc0-b8351814b6c2" label="lyrics-like">púlcro misericórdiam túam, * et</l><l xml:id="m-99c5cd3e-5d7b-40a1-896e-e934c63f24ae" facs="#m-0811a7ff-fe41-4655-83fc-96b8040536d3" label="lyrics-like">tibus in lácum :* fáctus sum sicut</l><l xml:id="m-f0fa8f06-d58a-43bd-8bad-09dd7a7331d5" facs="#m-01ea5834-e8ed-4efb-83e1-1b3cb5b58ca8" label="lyrics-like">veritátem túam in perditióne?</l><l xml:id="m-c91a1e24-4c1d-4de1-9994-3adb3db9481d" facs="#m-5deb5a9e-9dc7-41d0-847a-914bdec831c5" label="lyrics-like">hómo sine adjutório, inter mórtuos</l><l xml:id="m-22eddf48-ba14-481d-b95a-c29f0be8861e" facs="#m-32a4320e-defb-4220-bf4f-4b1f62fd9967" label="lyrics-like">Numquid cognoscéntur in téne¬</l><l xml:id="m-05268873-14a1-458e-b117-2dbe7e6cb1e6" facs="#m-cd561a14-0264-4390-a1ff-66a55c403f9b" label="ambiguous">liber.</l><l xml:id="m-56b93dd5-53ba-47e7-91ce-286d772f1d33" facs="#m-03c1f8b1-ee3c-4a0a-8d6a-dc6045c71549" label="lyrics-like">bris mirabilia tua, * et justítia túa</l><l xml:id="m-09452c04-19ef-463f-8760-60d104ee6d38" facs="#m-cfa48ed4-e6ae-4a9f-9781-2ca840041d56" label="lyrics-like">Sicut vulneráti dormiéntes in</l><l xml:id="m-c0a94861-6184-4c8f-b96f-f43a55a8ff95" facs="#m-de40f06a-56b2-47f8-9bf9-c6cbc5cbeb4b" label="lyrics-like">in térra obliviónis?</l><l xml:id="m-50f12141-2f94-48d7-bbba-880d78462a97" facs="#m-e5c6879a-f315-4169-b9c4-7f82919bbd59" label="lyrics-like">Et égo ad te, Dómine, clamávi :*</l><l xml:id="m-2f895773-cd7e-4a7a-986a-6067f75ff096" facs="#m-d5c6d8ac-8fb4-44fd-9feb-b00d50f7c919" label="lyrics-like">sepúlcris, f quórum non es mémor</l><l xml:id="m-4371d66a-be36-4183-988f-dbeaa0d3ecf7" facs="#m-b009d8ca-5cb0-4d0a-8683-ec8f31ea289a" label="lyrics-like">amplius: * et ipsi de mánu túa</l><l xml:id="m-9c978b0f-f0c4-409f-84f2-0848e1eff3bc" facs="#m-9b83056d-dd45-405a-836b-ffc089962f98" label="lyrics-like">et mane orátio méa praevéniet te.</l><l xml:id="m-1398983a-a18e-441f-9c0d-9932e16d66e2" facs="#m-38b617aa-3675-4a3c-9f79-1bcfff9faa9a" label="lyrics-like">Ut quid, Dómine, repéllis oratió¬</l><l xml:id="m-bd98cbf4-39cc-4ab8-9203-e155624f670f" facs="#m-879f2962-02e6-4f39-9f43-b3aa8b330f1f" label="lyrics-like">repülsi sunt.</l><l xml:id="m-75c17489-ad6d-46c3-8b2b-53650bda5086" facs="#m-e6404561-5184-49b8-a8ac-f290010c268b" label="lyrics-like">Posuérunt me in lácu inferióri:*</l><l xml:id="m-030562e5-49cb-4795-9a12-f5d15ab5b56d" facs="#m-0bd99f7c-16db-411f-9a4e-386374cfb221" label="lyrics-like">nem meam:* avértis fáciem túam</l><l xml:id="m-0c9b80ec-55e5-4063-ab47-3de8bfbef6cb" facs="#m-36fd2829-5dd6-4785-8613-612a2cfd835b" label="lyrics-like">in tenebrósis et in úmora mórtis.</l><l xml:id="m-006c265f-cb95-4053-8796-5fe42ecf09a5" facs="#m-db0e8a29-5da6-4ca1-bdba-23b7914b92ee" label="ambiguous">a me?</l><l xml:id="m-50bceab8-c482-4499-a2e4-b1816320f38c" facs="#m-c9390eab-4a8e-4dda-ae4f-c139c1f11457" label="lyrics-like">Pauper sum égo, et in labóribus</l><l xml:id="m-ed4f0c59-ebaa-495f-b0f8-270a02a59e46" facs="#m-de6cd1a2-1038-47af-9a8e-956a44a1d183" label="lyrics-like">Super me confirmátus est fúror</l><l xml:id="m-9e9f9620-6361-4805-ba61-f02f6b83a43c" facs="#m-e52fbb5f-06ba-43a7-9fef-17e421e236ee" label="lyrics-like">a juventúte méa:* exaltátus au¬</l><l xml:id="m-84a33abf-2fdb-4be0-8384-47107aff750d" facs="#m-d36e2c60-2394-4d75-bf1d-041eec5f5904" label="lyrics-like">túus :* et ómnes flúctus túos indu¬</l><l xml:id="m-bd3deb7e-6b49-417c-9475-b1343c92229f" facs="#m-d09f59e6-2fcd-4e54-9d00-808036f88489" label="lyrics-like">tem, humiliátus sum et conturbátus.</l><l xml:id="m-bffb8f18-8ce1-4d11-8165-79751df56f96" facs="#m-6e60a59a-f4a8-417d-b8a7-af42818e72a3" label="lyrics-like">xísti super me.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>